WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
In 1784, a boy stood blindfolded in a garden near Paris.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
One apricot tree had been prepared by a practitioner of animal magnetism.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The boy approached four other trees. His symptoms grew stronger.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
At the fourth, he fainted. That tree had not been magnetized.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
The commissioners investigated a proposed cause, not whether his distress was real.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Before buying a brainwave promise, separate the experience from proof of the mechanism.
